      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello. I\u0027ve been internally testing VPP on my CI with many test cases and came across this edge case where an admin-down interface in vpp can blackhole routed traffic when lcp-sync is on; and worse when the interface returns it will route traffic for routes no longer installed in Linux. I think it\u0027s a simple fix, if you have a few minutes to take a look thx.",
      "revId": "c72d5187c343c4db817fd8829f09bdf5aae33c41",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
    },
